      "id": 489413,
      "username": "Dumach",
      "name": "Alex Nagy",
      "created_at": "2025-12-23T10:39:22.621Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>There are 2 options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>System wide: <strong>System Settings &gt; App &gt; Default App</strong> - you can select it</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Personal / User base: <strong>User &gt; “Your Username“ &gt; Settings &gt; App &gt; Default App</strong></p>\n<p>OR Click on your <strong>avatar icon &gt; My Settings &gt; App &gt; Default App</strong> (which is same)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0\" title=\"kép\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0_2_549x500.png\" alt=\"kép\" data-base62-sha1=\"jBtW0rt1Y3xBo3A5KZ0Qf6k7daE\" width=\"549\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0_2_549x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/8965fe95b0f4f872fb299abee9e0fb177115a2d0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">kép</span><span class=\"informations\">811×738 42.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If your application does not show up there, you have to check your custom application’s <code>hooks.py</code></p>\n<p>link: <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/apps-page\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Apps Page</a></p>\n<p>Hopefully, this will solve your problem,</p>\n<p>Alex</p>",
